_symmetry_space_group_name_H-M 'F m -3 m'
loop_
_atom_site_label
_atom_site_type_symbol
_atom_site_fract_x
_atom_site_fract_y
_atom_site_fract_z
Na1 Na 0 0 0
Cl1 Cl 0.5 0.5 0.5
